WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:03.044
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.128 --> 00:05.171
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.255 --> 00:06.506
I can't  hear  you!
我听不到你说话！

00:06.589 --> 00:08.508
Kids:   Aye, aye,
Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊
队长！

00:08.591 --> 00:11.177
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.261 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.390
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.473 --> 00:17.600
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.684 --> 00:19.102
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.106
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.440 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.985
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.068 --> 00:27.944
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.278 --> 00:29.571
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.654 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:37.203
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:57.474 --> 00:59.726
O.K., and would you like
any fries with that?
好的，你愿意吗
有薯条吗？

00:59.809 --> 01:03.104
Hey, if I get some kelp fries,
will you guys share 'em with me?
嘿 如果我买点海带薯条
你们愿意和我分享吗？

01:03.188 --> 01:05.148
Do we know you?
我们认识你吗？

01:05.231 --> 01:07.275
Two orders of fries, please.
请点两份薯条。

01:07.358 --> 01:08.526
And two orders of...
还有两份订单...

01:08.610 --> 01:10.111
I only said one order.
我只说了一个命令。

01:10.195 --> 01:11.404
I thought you said, "Two."
我以为你说的是​​“两个”

01:11.488 --> 01:12.906
O.K., I'll have two.
好吧，我要两个。

01:14.032 --> 01:16.451
SpongeBob, order up.
海绵宝宝，快点下单吧

01:18.703 --> 01:20.038
Welcome to the Krusty...
欢迎来到库斯蒂...

01:21.206 --> 01:24.042
SpongeBob, what in Neptune's...
海绵宝宝，在海王星的...

01:25.376 --> 01:26.836
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

01:32.425 --> 01:36.471
Well, his spatula's still warm.
嗯，他的抹刀还是热的。

01:38.181 --> 01:39.557
Well, SpongeBob...
嗯，海绵宝宝...

01:39.641 --> 01:41.976
I must admit
this is strange behavior...
我必须承认
这是奇怪的行为......

01:42.060 --> 01:43.853
even for you.
即使是为了你。

01:43.937 --> 01:44.979
Ahoy, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

01:45.063 --> 01:45.939
Good Neptune.
好海王星。

01:46.314 --> 01:47.774
SpongeBob, what's gotten
into you, son?
海绵宝宝，得到了什么
儿子，喜欢你吗？

01:47.857 --> 01:50.360
I think he's in some kind
of self-induced trance.
我认为他是某种
自我诱发的恍惚状态。

01:50.443 --> 01:52.779
No, Squidward,
this is worse.
不，章鱼哥，
这更糟。

01:52.862 --> 01:55.532
He's got the
thousand-yard stare.
他有
千码凝视。

01:55.615 --> 01:58.993
I had it once me-self,
back in me service days.
我自己也经历过一次，
回到我服役的日子。

01:59.077 --> 02:00.328
What is it lad?
小伙子这是什么？

02:00.411 --> 02:03.039
Quick, we're losin' money.
快点，我们正在赔钱。

02:04.541 --> 02:05.917
It's the boy's tiny calendar.
这是男孩的小日历。

02:06.000 --> 02:07.544
And he's circled today's date.
他圈出了今天的日期。

02:07.627 --> 02:11.214
"Important food critic
visits Krusty Krab?"
“重要美食评论家
拜访蟹堡王？”

02:11.297 --> 02:12.882
That's what's causing all this?
这就是造成这一切的原因？

02:13.299 --> 02:17.887
Only a complete moron
would worry about what
some critic has to say.
只是一个彻头彻尾的白痴
会担心什么
一些批评家不得不说。

02:19.472 --> 02:20.765
I rest my case.
我休息一下。

02:30.775 --> 02:32.151
Hey, in or out, mister.
嘿，无论进还是出，先生。

02:32.235 --> 02:33.862
You're letting out the A.C.
你把空调放出去了

02:36.948 --> 02:37.866
Weirdo.
怪人。

02:41.369 --> 02:42.787
Why hello.
为什么你好。

02:43.079 --> 02:46.165
You're the television food
critic Gene Scallop, aren't ya?
你就是电视里的食物
评论家吉恩·扇贝，不是吗？

02:46.249 --> 02:47.458
Allow me to introduce myself.
请允许我自我介绍一下。

02:47.917 --> 02:51.045
I'm Eugene Krabs, owner and
proprietor of this fine...
我是尤金·克拉布斯 (Eugene Krabs)，业主
这张罚单的主人...

02:52.380 --> 02:56.009
Well, do you wanna order
something or do you just
wanna block my reading light?
嗯，你想订购吗
某事或者你只是
想挡住我的阅读灯吗？

02:57.010 --> 02:59.888
Squidward, you just
drove away Gene Scallop!
章鱼哥，你刚刚
赶走了吉恩·扇贝！

02:59.971 --> 03:01.973
Don't you know our lives
depend on his review?
你难道不知道我们的生活吗
取决于他的评论？

03:02.056 --> 03:04.183
Mr. Krabs, the only thing
my life depends on
蟹老板，唯一的事
我的生活取决于

03:04.267 --> 03:06.102
is going home at 6:00.
6:00 回家。

03:07.604 --> 03:09.647
M... Mr. Scallop,
wait, please.
M...扇贝先生，
请稍等。

03:09.731 --> 03:12.567
Before you go,
come on, sit down.
在你走之前，
来吧，坐下。

03:12.650 --> 03:14.652
Try one of our delicious
Krabby Patties.
尝尝我们的美味之一
蟹肉饼。

03:14.736 --> 03:17.363
It's absolutely f-f-f...
这绝对是f-f-f...

03:18.698 --> 03:20.867
Complimentary.
免费。

03:27.624 --> 03:32.545
O.K., SpongeBob,
that'll be all.
好吧，海绵宝宝，
仅此而已。

03:32.629 --> 03:34.839
He's nobody.
他什么都不是。

03:44.515 --> 03:46.142
We're doomed.
我们注定了。

03:46.809 --> 03:49.103
And there were no survivors.
无人生还。

03:49.187 --> 03:50.188
Thank you, Barbara.
谢谢你，芭芭拉。

03:50.271 --> 03:51.522
Thank you, Bob.
谢谢你，鲍勃。

03:51.606 --> 03:53.483
She is so tacky.
她太俗气了。

03:53.566 --> 03:56.736
Bob: And now it's time
for "Bottom Feeding"
with Gene Scallop.
鲍勃：现在是时候了
对于“底部喂食”
与吉恩扇贝。

03:56.819 --> 03:58.154
Turn it up, Squidward.
把它打开，章鱼哥。

03:58.237 --> 03:59.155
Thank you, Bob.
谢谢你，鲍勃。

03:59.238 --> 04:00.198
This week, I visited...
这周，我访问了...

04:00.281 --> 04:01.616
Bob: You're
welcome, Gene.
鲍勃：你是
欢迎，吉恩。

04:05.787 --> 04:08.706
This week I reviewed
the Krusty Krab restaurant
这周我回顾了
蟹堡王餐厅

04:08.790 --> 04:11.334
a local burger joint
that's second to none.
当地的汉堡店
这是首屈一指的。

04:11.417 --> 04:12.961
Or should I say second to "run"
或者我应该说第二个“跑”

04:13.044 --> 04:16.005
since this critic wanted to make
like a banana and peel out
因为这位批评家想要使
像香蕉一样剥掉

04:16.089 --> 04:19.300
the minute he saw how drab
this Krab really was.
当他看到多么单调的那一刻
这蟹确实是。

04:19.384 --> 04:20.843
That bad, huh Gene?
太糟糕了，对吧吉恩？

04:20.927 --> 04:23.554
Barbara, once I stuck my beak
through that door
芭芭拉，一旦我伸出嘴
通过那扇门

04:23.638 --> 04:25.473
my appetite flew south
for the winter.
我的胃口南飞
为了冬天。

04:25.556 --> 04:28.226
I mean, I'm not "kidding"
when I say this restaurant
我是说，我不是在“开玩笑”
当我说这家餐厅时

04:28.309 --> 04:30.561
smells like the
rear end of a goat.
闻起来像
山羊的后端。

04:31.729 --> 04:33.106
And how was the service, Gene?
吉恩，服务怎么样？

04:33.189 --> 04:35.483
You could find livelier help
in a graveyard
你可以找到更生动的帮助
在墓地里

04:35.566 --> 04:38.277
and I'm not just "coffin."
我不只是“棺材”。

04:38.361 --> 04:39.779
The management stunk so bad
管理太糟糕了

04:39.988 --> 04:42.532
I had to get my sweater
dry cleaned on the way home
我得去拿我的毛衣
回家路上干洗

04:42.615 --> 04:43.741
with me in it.
和我在一起。

04:45.326 --> 04:46.452
Krab: Hey, no, wait, wait!
蟹蟹：嘿，不，等等，等等！

04:46.536 --> 04:48.413
However, at the end of my visit
然而，在我访问结束时

04:48.496 --> 04:51.791
I chowed down on a meal that
titillated my taste buds
我狼吞虎咽地吃了一顿饭
刺激了我的味蕾

04:51.874 --> 04:52.875
and gratified my gullet.
并满足了我的喉咙。

04:53.251 --> 04:55.253
That sponge behind the grill
is no square
烤架后面的海绵
不是正方形

04:55.336 --> 04:56.629
when it comes to cooking!
当谈到烹饪时！

04:58.881 --> 05:00.842
If Krabs really wanted
to soak up the dough
如果蟹蟹真的想要的话
吸收面团

05:00.925 --> 05:02.260
he'd sponge it up.
他会把它擦掉。

05:02.343 --> 05:04.220
He'd sponge it out,
he'd over-sponge it.
他会用海绵把它擦掉，
他会过度海绵它。

05:04.303 --> 05:07.640
You can never have
too much sponge.
你永远不可能拥有
海绵太多。

05:07.724 --> 05:10.143
Well, back to work.
好吧，回去工作吧。

05:10.226 --> 05:11.227
Ay, ay-ay-ay-ay...
哎呀呀呀呀...

05:11.310 --> 05:13.312
That's me boy, SpongeBob!
这就是我，海绵宝宝！

05:13.396 --> 05:14.564
That's me boy.
这就是我，男孩。

05:17.066 --> 05:19.318
♪ Tra-la-la, la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦，啦啦啦啦 ♪

05:19.402 --> 05:20.403
Wow...
哇...

05:20.737 --> 05:22.655
Krab: O.K.,
a little lower,  lower...
蟹蟹：好的，
低一点，低一点……

05:22.739 --> 05:23.823
That's perfect.
那很完美。

05:24.198 --> 05:25.783
Good morning, sir,
what's with the new sign?
早上好，先生，
新标志怎么了？

05:25.867 --> 05:27.827
Oh, just makin'
a few cosmetic changes.
哦，只是在做
一些外观上的改变。

05:27.910 --> 05:30.830
Oh, you mean, like when
Squidward had that mole
taken off his...
哦，你的意思是，就像当
章鱼哥有那颗痣
脱下了他的...

05:30.913 --> 05:34.042
Eh, well, yeah,
a little bit like that.
呃，嗯，是的，
有点像那样。

05:36.335 --> 05:37.628
Morning, Squidward!
早上好，章鱼哥！

05:37.712 --> 05:38.755
Ooh.
哦。

05:39.130 --> 05:41.174
Squidward, where did
you find those shoes?
章鱼哥，去哪儿了
你找到那双鞋了吗？

05:43.593 --> 05:44.552
Child: Look, it's him.
孩子：看，就是他。

05:44.635 --> 05:45.845
Mr. SquarePants?
方裤先生？

05:45.928 --> 05:47.680
Can I have
your autograph?
我可以有
你的签名？

05:47.764 --> 05:49.390
But, why?
但为什么？

05:49.474 --> 05:50.892
Well, the first reason is
嗯，第一个原因是

05:50.975 --> 05:52.977
I have no use
of my arms, see?
我没有用
我的手臂，看到了吗？

05:53.061 --> 05:53.936
Ow!
噢！

05:54.103 --> 05:55.688
Hey, what's going on over here?
嘿，这里发生了什么事？

05:55.772 --> 05:57.106
He hit me...
他打我...

05:57.190 --> 05:59.233
Just 'cause I wanted
his autograph.
只是因为我想要
他的签名。

05:59.317 --> 06:00.318
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

06:00.401 --> 06:02.195
I'm sorry, little girl.
对不起，小女孩。

06:02.278 --> 06:05.156
Of course you can
have his autograph...
当然可以
有他的亲笔签名...

06:05.239 --> 06:06.282
for five bucks.
五块钱。

06:06.365 --> 06:07.533
What a rip.
真是撕裂啊。

06:07.617 --> 06:09.869
Look at these, Squidward,
heh, heh, heh.
看看这些，章鱼哥，
呵呵，呵呵。

06:09.952 --> 06:12.038
Looks like some
sort of horrific shroud.
看起来有些
有点可怕的裹尸布。

06:12.121 --> 06:15.124
They're our new
Krusty sponge napkins.
他们是我们的新人
Krusty 海绵餐巾。

06:15.208 --> 06:17.627
Extra absorbent...
额外的吸水性...

06:17.710 --> 06:19.128
You really need to see a doctor.
你确实需要去看医生。

06:19.212 --> 06:20.797
Oh, that reminds me, Squidward.
哦，这让我想起了，章鱼哥。

06:20.880 --> 06:22.548
I need you to
unpack these boxes.
我需要你
打开这些盒子的包装。

06:22.632 --> 06:24.967
What's in them?
它们里面有什么？

06:25.051 --> 06:26.886
We got Tangy Spongey Sauce
我们有浓郁的海绵酱

06:26.969 --> 06:29.639
and Mild Bobby Sauce,
for the not so daring.
和温和的鲍比酱，
对于那些不太大胆的人。

06:29.722 --> 06:31.224
Oh, clever.
哦，聪明。

06:31.307 --> 06:32.183
Captain!
队长！

06:32.266 --> 06:33.559
My spatula's missing, sir!
我的铲子不见了，先生！

06:33.643 --> 06:34.852
I got it right here.
我在这里就明白了。

06:34.936 --> 06:35.937
Here ya go, Squidward.
给你，章鱼哥。

06:36.020 --> 06:37.396
You're on grill duty now.
你现在正在烧烤。

06:37.480 --> 06:39.482
But that's SpongeBob's job.
但这是海绵宝宝的工作。

06:39.565 --> 06:40.733
Don't worry, Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

06:40.817 --> 06:43.236
I got somethin' else
lined up for him.
我还有别的东西
为他排队。

06:46.823 --> 06:48.157
Step right up, folks.
站起来，伙计们。

06:48.241 --> 06:51.452
Take a ride on the
Krusty Sponge Fun Train.
乘坐
Krusty 海绵趣味火车。

06:51.536 --> 06:52.995
Tickets are only $1.98.
门票仅需 1.98 美元。

06:53.079 --> 06:54.288
Seat belts not included.
不包括安全带。

06:56.749 --> 07:00.169
Squidward: How am I gonna
do this now?
章鱼哥：我该怎么办
现在就做这个吗？

07:04.924 --> 07:06.592
Mommy, is that you?
妈妈，是你吗？

07:10.429 --> 07:13.349
Mr. Krabs, I really think
I should be getting back
to the grill now.
蟹老板，我真的认为
我应该回来了
现在去烤架吧。

07:13.432 --> 07:14.600
Are you kidding, lad?
你在开玩笑吧，小伙子？

07:14.684 --> 07:16.018
Just look at all these
payin' customers.
看看所有这些
付费客户。

07:16.102 --> 07:18.229
Who's ready for another lap?
谁准备好再跑一圈了？

07:19.730 --> 07:21.274
Keep on truckin', SpongeBob.
继续前进吧，海绵宝宝。

07:21.357 --> 07:24.360
I got some important business
to see to in me office.
我有一些重要的事情
来我办公室看看。

07:24.443 --> 07:25.486
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

07:25.695 --> 07:28.072
Uh, this is a bad time,
isn't it.
呃，这段时间不好，
不是吗。

07:28.156 --> 07:29.574
No.
不。

07:30.867 --> 07:34.495
Well, there's a man out back
with a delivery and says
you need to sign.
嗯，后面有一个人
送货并说
你需要签名。

07:34.579 --> 07:35.580
O.K.
好的。

07:35.663 --> 07:36.789
Tell him, I'll be right out.
告诉他，我马上就出去。

07:36.873 --> 07:37.790
Got it.
知道了。

07:37.874 --> 07:38.875
Ow!
噢！

07:39.208 --> 07:42.170
And let's watch
the language, Squidward.
让我们看一下
语言，章鱼哥。

07:42.253 --> 07:44.505
Sign here, here,
and here.
在这里签名，在这里，
还有这里。

07:44.589 --> 07:45.965
My pleasure.
我的荣幸。

07:46.048 --> 07:47.800
What the heck
is all this stuff?
到底是什么
都是这些东西吗？

07:47.884 --> 07:48.885
I'm glad you asked!
我很高兴你问了！

07:49.093 --> 07:50.636
We got SpongeBob
drinking straws...
我们有海绵宝宝
吸管...

07:50.720 --> 07:51.804
coasters, bibs...
杯垫、围兜...

07:52.138 --> 07:55.516
and me personal favorite,
SpongeBob ice cubes.
还有我个人最喜欢的，
海绵宝宝冰块。

07:55.600 --> 07:56.726
Ohh...
哦...

07:57.101 --> 07:58.394
Mr. Krabs, don't you think
you might be taking
蟹老板，你不觉得吗
你可能正在服用

07:58.477 --> 08:01.022
all of this
a little bit too far?
所有这一切
有点太远了？

08:01.105 --> 08:02.481
Get back to work, SpongeBob.
回去工作吧，海绵宝宝。

08:02.565 --> 08:05.067
I'll be in me SpongeBob
if you SpongeBob me.
我会成为海绵宝宝
如果你是海绵宝宝我。

08:09.405 --> 08:11.532
Ha, ha...
哈、哈...

08:11.616 --> 08:14.660
Whoops...
哎呀...

08:14.744 --> 08:15.786
There ya go, Squidward?
好啦，章鱼哥？

08:15.870 --> 08:16.787
Now what?
现在怎么办？

08:16.871 --> 08:18.998
Oh, you're gonna love this!
哦，你一定会喜欢这个的！

08:19.081 --> 08:21.334
Spongey Patties.
海绵馅饼。

08:21.417 --> 08:22.585
Spongey Patties?
海绵馅饼？

08:22.960 --> 08:25.671
I want you to
start using 'em.
我要你
开始使用它们。

08:25.755 --> 08:29.508
They were just Patties we didn't
have room for in the freezer,
they turned yellow.
他们只是我们没有的馅饼
冰箱里有空间，
它们变黄了。

08:29.592 --> 08:32.220
Gotta keep those SpongeBob ice
cubes somewhere, you know.
一定要保留海绵宝宝的冰块
立方体在某个地方，你知道。

08:32.303 --> 08:35.056
You mean to tell me
you actually expect people
你是想告诉我
你实际上期望人们

08:35.139 --> 08:37.808
to pay $1.98
for a rotten Patty?
支付 1.98 美元
为了一个烂帕蒂？

08:37.892 --> 08:39.685
Squidward, you're right.
章鱼哥，你说得对。

08:39.769 --> 08:42.855
This instant success must be
scramblin' my brains.
这种急功近利一定是
搅乱我的大脑。

08:42.939 --> 08:45.900
We'll make 'em $2.98.
我们会给他们 2.98 美元。

08:49.487 --> 08:51.197
All aboard.
全部上船。

08:51.280 --> 08:54.075
Hey, we didn't pay $3
to watch you take a nap.
嘿，我们没有付 3 美元
看着你小睡。

08:54.158 --> 08:57.453
That's the worst SpongeBob
costume I've ever seen.
这是最糟糕的海绵宝宝
我见过的服装。

08:57.536 --> 08:58.538
All chanting: Ride, ride
所有人都在喊：骑，骑

08:58.621 --> 08:59.830
ride, ride
骑，骑

08:59.914 --> 09:00.998
ride, ride
骑，骑

09:01.082 --> 09:03.584
ride, ride, ride, ride...
骑，骑，骑，骑……

09:06.420 --> 09:07.630
ride, ride
骑，骑

09:07.713 --> 09:10.299
ride, ride, ride.
骑，骑，骑。

09:11.509 --> 09:13.094
Oh, what a day.
哦，多么美好的一天啊。

09:13.177 --> 09:15.179
What's next,
a zombie invasion?
接下来是什么，
僵尸入侵？

09:15.263 --> 09:16.597
Ahh!
啊！

09:19.016 --> 09:20.518
Mr. Krabs, open up.
蟹老板，请开门。

09:20.810 --> 09:23.271
We're being attacked by a bunch
of zombies that look like me.
我们正遭到一群人的攻击
那些看起来像我的僵尸。

09:23.354 --> 09:25.815
Krabs behind door: Uh, go away,
please, I'm busy.
门后的螃蟹：呃，走开，
拜托，我很忙。

09:25.898 --> 09:27.275
Please, you don't understand.
拜托，你不懂。

09:27.358 --> 09:29.568
They're all splotchy and yellow
它们都是有斑点和黄色的

09:29.652 --> 09:31.737
with distended bellies.
腹部肿胀。

09:33.489 --> 09:35.449
Open up, open up,
open up, open up.
开放，开放，
开放，开放。

09:35.533 --> 09:36.701
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

09:37.952 --> 09:38.786
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

09:38.869 --> 09:39.829
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

09:40.204 --> 09:42.081
Great Neptune's
mother's stockings.
伟大的海王星
妈妈的丝袜。

09:42.164 --> 09:43.666
Krabs: Zombies...
螃蟹：僵尸……

09:43.749 --> 09:45.376
They're here to eat me money.
他们来这里是为了吃我的钱。

09:45.459 --> 09:48.045
Wait, they're not
zombies, Mr. Krabs.
等等，他们不是
僵尸，蟹老板。

09:48.129 --> 09:50.047
They're your customers... Look.
他们是你的客户......看。

09:50.131 --> 09:55.636
Oh, I ate this yellow Krabby
Patty and now I feel sick.
哦，我吃了这只黄色的蟹蟹
帕蒂，现在我感觉不舒服。

09:55.720 --> 09:57.596
Krabby Patty?
克拉比·帕蒂？

09:59.056 --> 10:01.892
Yech  .
耶赫。

10:02.977 --> 10:05.021
Man, you got some
serious problems.
伙计，你有一些
严重的问题。

10:05.104 --> 10:07.440
If you're trying to pass that
off as a Krabby Patty...
如果你想通过这个
作为蟹黄派蒂...

10:07.523 --> 10:10.693
It's a...
It's a spongey Patty.
这是一个...
这是一块海绵状的帕蒂。

10:10.776 --> 10:13.696
Mr. Krabs,
what have you done?
蟹老板先生，
你做了什么？

10:13.779 --> 10:16.198
You poisoned all these people.
你毒害了所有这些人。

10:16.282 --> 10:18.784
No, but, I, I just...
不，但是，我，我只是……

10:18.868 --> 10:20.369
I can explain, I...
我可以解释一下，我...

10:20.453 --> 10:21.287
What the...
什么...

10:21.370 --> 10:23.539
Tell it to the judge, Krabs.
告诉法官，蟹老板。

10:24.665 --> 10:27.251
Calling the courtroom to
attention in the case of
呼吁法庭
注意的情况下

10:27.335 --> 10:30.129
"People of Bikini Bottom
versus Mr. Krabs."
“比基尼泳裤的人们
对抗蟹老板。”

10:30.212 --> 10:32.798
Honorable Judge
Horace A. Whopper presiding.
尊敬的法官
霍勒斯·A·沃珀 (Horace A. Whopper) 主持。

10:34.050 --> 10:36.218
Has the jury reached a verdict?
陪审团做出裁决了吗？

10:36.302 --> 10:38.304
We have, Your Honor.
我们有，法官大人。

10:38.387 --> 10:41.265
We, the jury, find the
defendant, Eugene A. Krabs
我们，陪审团，发现
被告，尤金·A·克拉布斯

10:41.349 --> 10:43.559
guilty of all charges.
犯有所有指控。

10:43.642 --> 10:44.935
Very well.
很好。

10:45.019 --> 10:46.645
Does the defendant
have anything to say
被告是否
有话要说

10:46.729 --> 10:49.190
before we send him
down  the river?
在我们送他之前
顺流而下？

10:49.273 --> 10:50.691
No, Your Honor.
不，法官大人。

10:50.775 --> 10:51.984
Very well.
很好。

10:53.402 --> 10:55.404
Eh, hang on
a second there, judge.
呃，坚持住
请稍等一下，法官。

10:55.488 --> 10:58.616
That wouldn't happen to be
a SpongeBob gavel you're usin'?
那不会发生
你用的是海绵宝宝木槌吗？

10:58.699 --> 11:01.660
Ooh, why yes,
it's my prized possession.
哦，为什么是的，
这是我珍贵的财产。

11:01.744 --> 11:03.496
I am a huge SpongeBob fan.
我是海绵宝宝的超级粉丝。

11:03.579 --> 11:06.123
Permission to approach
the bench, Your Honor.
允许接近
长凳，法官大人。

11:07.958 --> 11:10.711
Sure is good to be back
behind the grill where
I belong, Mr. Krabs.
回来当然很好
烤架后面哪里
我属于，蟹老板。

11:10.795 --> 11:12.630
It's good to have you back, boy.
很高兴你回来了，孩子。

11:12.713 --> 11:15.591
Let's see how Squidward's
enjoying his new position.
来看看章鱼哥是怎么做的
享受他的新职位。

11:19.220 --> 11:21.430
Take him around there
as many times as you like.
带他去那里转转
想要多少次都可以。

11:21.514 --> 11:24.141
I just might have to
take you up on that.
我可能不得不这样做
带你去解决这个问题。

11:26.060 --> 11:28.229
Ah, I love a happy ending.
啊，我喜欢幸福的结局。

11:28.312 --> 11:30.940
Eh-eh-eh-eh-eh...
诶诶诶诶……

11:46.247 --> 11:50.042
Ah, no, no!
啊，不，不！

11:53.671 --> 11:55.464
Yay...
耶...

11:55.548 --> 11:59.176
Oh, if only Inaudible Lad
were here right now.
噢，要是听不见的小伙子就好了
现在就在这里。

11:59.260 --> 12:00.177
Ohh...
哦...

12:01.971 --> 12:05.850
Nothing satisfies
like a good story.
没有什么可以满足的
就像一个好故事。

12:05.933 --> 12:07.560
Are ya ready to go, Patrick?
帕特里克，你准备好了吗？

12:07.643 --> 12:08.644
Ah, get back!
啊，快回来吧！

12:08.727 --> 12:09.937
I wasn't gonna
eat all of you!
我本来没打算
把你们都吃掉！

12:10.020 --> 12:11.522
Patrick, it's me.
帕特里克，是我。

12:11.605 --> 12:12.731
Sponge...
海绵...

12:12.815 --> 12:14.483
Ew, what's this?
呃，这是什么？

12:14.567 --> 12:16.026
Whatever it is, it's mine...
不管是什么，它都是我的……

12:16.110 --> 12:17.778
Unless I don't want it.
除非我不想要它。

12:17.862 --> 12:19.363
Mm-hm...
嗯嗯...

12:19.447 --> 12:20.406
Hm, hm.
嗯，嗯。

12:20.489 --> 12:21.407
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

12:21.490 --> 12:22.741
What do all these words say?
这些话都说了什么？

12:22.825 --> 12:23.993
It's an ad.
这是一个广告。

12:24.368 --> 12:25.453
SpongeBob as Announcer:
Dear comic book reader.
海绵宝宝担任播音员：
亲爱的漫画读者。

12:25.536 --> 12:27.204
That's me!
这就是我！

12:27.913 --> 12:30.708
Have you ever thought about
turning one of your poems into
a song on the radio?
你有没有想过
把你的一首诗变成
广播里的一首歌？

12:30.791 --> 12:32.001
I've never thought
about anything.
我从来没有想过
关于任何事情。

12:32.418 --> 12:35.296
Send in your poem and $100
and we'll make it a hit.
寄出你的诗和 100 美元
我们会让它大受欢迎。

12:35.379 --> 12:37.506
Can we go now?
My arms are getting tired.
我们现在可以走了吗？
我的手臂越来越累了。

12:37.590 --> 12:39.008
I wanna send in a poem
我想寄一首诗

12:39.091 --> 12:41.886
and everyone would love it,
and I would be a star.
每个人都会喜欢它，
我会成为明星。

12:41.969 --> 12:43.846
You can't always trust ads
in comic books.
你不能总是相信广告
在漫画书中。

12:44.013 --> 12:48.058
Those X-ray specs I ordered
couldn't see through people's
skin at all...
我订购的那些 X 射线规格
无法看透人们的
皮肤根本...

12:48.142 --> 12:49.477
Only their clothes,
只有他们的衣服，

12:49.560 --> 12:51.103
plus, you don't have $100.
另外，你没有 100 美元。

12:51.187 --> 12:54.273
Uh, Patrick,
could you get my wallet?
呃，帕特里克，
你能拿走我的钱包吗？

12:54.356 --> 12:58.277
Hey, look,
I just found $100.
嘿，看，
我刚刚找到了 100 美元。

12:58.360 --> 13:01.280
It's a sign that
I should make my hit record.
这是一个迹象
我应该创造我的热门记录。

13:01.363 --> 13:03.240
Hey, that's my
comic book money.
嘿，那是我的
漫画书钱。

13:03.324 --> 13:04.533
It's a sign...
这是一个标志...

13:04.617 --> 13:06.952
A sign that fell from
the back of your pants.
一个从上面掉下来的牌子
你裤子的后面。

13:07.036 --> 13:09.121
I've learned to trust
signs like that.
我学会了信任
像那样的迹象。

13:09.205 --> 13:10.414
Patrick?
帕特里克？

13:10.498 --> 13:13.125
Hey, you gonna pay
for those comics?
嘿，你要付钱
对于那些漫画？

13:13.209 --> 13:14.251
No.
不。

13:15.211 --> 13:18.339
Oh, can I have my arms back?
哦，我可以把我的手臂收回来吗？

13:18.422 --> 13:21.467
Patrick: I wish not to be
disturbed, SpongeBob
帕特里克：我不想成为
海绵宝宝，不安

13:21.550 --> 13:25.638
for I am about to erupt
with a masterpiece.
因为我即将爆发
与杰作。

13:25.721 --> 13:27.306
Good luck.
祝你好运。

13:28.390 --> 13:30.059
Coming... Oh!
来了……哦！

13:30.142 --> 13:34.188
Could I borrow a pencil and
some paper and a place to work?
我可以借一支铅笔吗
一些文件和工作地点？

13:36.232 --> 13:38.817
SpongeBob,
this pencil is broken.
海绵宝宝，
这支铅笔坏了。

13:38.901 --> 13:40.236
Why won't it make words?
为什么不会说话呢？

13:40.319 --> 13:42.863
You have to think
of the words yourself.
你必须思考
自己的话。

13:42.947 --> 13:45.699
I think I wrote a poem once.
我想我曾经写过一首诗。

13:45.783 --> 13:48.994
A poem by Patrick Star.
帕特里克·斯塔的一首诗。

13:49.078 --> 13:50.496
Roses are blue.
玫瑰是蓝色的。

13:50.579 --> 13:51.830
Violets are red.
紫罗兰是红色的。

13:51.914 --> 13:54.583
I have to go to the bathroom.
我得去趟洗手间。

13:57.086 --> 13:59.380
How many times I gotta tell ya?
我要告诉你多少次？

13:59.463 --> 14:01.590
This is gym class.
这是体育课。

14:05.094 --> 14:07.137
Ooh, dodgeballs.
哦，躲避球。

14:08.764 --> 14:10.266
Oh, Patrick?
哦，帕特里克？

14:10.349 --> 14:12.893
Ah, don't hit me
with a dodgeball!
啊，别打我
用躲避球！

14:14.186 --> 14:15.396
Meow.
喵。

14:15.479 --> 14:17.856
Why would I hit you
with a dodgeball?
我为什么要打你
用躲避球？

14:17.940 --> 14:20.025
I've never told anyone this
我从来没有告诉过任何人这件事

14:20.109 --> 14:21.527
but I wrote a poem once.
但我曾经写过一首诗。

14:21.610 --> 14:22.486
No.
不。

14:22.570 --> 14:23.737
Wait, there's more.
等等，还有更多。

14:23.821 --> 14:25.698
When I read it to the class
当我向全班同学朗读时

14:25.781 --> 14:27.449
they pelted me with dodgeballs
他们用躲避球扔我

14:27.533 --> 14:30.536
just because we were
playing dodgeball!
只是因为我们
玩躲避球！

14:30.619 --> 14:32.037
Why...  ?
为什么...  ？

14:34.540 --> 14:36.542
You can play your
records later, Gary.
你可以玩你的
稍后记录，加里。

14:36.625 --> 14:39.628
Patrick, is that why you've been
having trouble writing?
帕特里克，这就是你一直以来的原因
写作有困难吗？

14:39.712 --> 14:42.590
I'm worried my poem's
not gonna be any good.
我担心我的诗
不会有任何好处。

14:42.673 --> 14:45.217
And you're gonna hit me
with dodgeballs.
你会打我
与躲避球。

14:45.301 --> 14:47.970
Oh, I don't even own
a dodgeball, do you, Gary?
哦，我什至不拥有
加里，你会玩躲避球吗？

14:48.053 --> 14:49.305
Meow.
喵。

14:49.388 --> 14:52.016
If you're serious,
I can do this.
如果你是认真的
我可以做到这一点。

14:52.099 --> 14:54.643
I'm even gonna use...
My brain.
我什至会用...
我的大脑。

14:54.727 --> 14:55.894
That's the spirit, Patrick!
这就是精神，帕特里克！

14:55.978 --> 14:57.479
I'll open a window.
我会打开一扇窗户。

15:01.567 --> 15:03.360
Ohh...
哦...

15:03.444 --> 15:04.778
Ho...
嗬……

15:10.117 --> 15:11.910
Come on, you stupid brain...
来吧，你这个愚蠢的大脑……

15:11.994 --> 15:13.412
Work.
工作。

15:16.832 --> 15:19.793
It's working.
它正在发挥作用。

15:19.877 --> 15:22.546
Patrick, don't strain yourself
帕特里克，别让自己太紧张

15:22.630 --> 15:25.007
now what's going on?
现在发生了什么事？

15:25.090 --> 15:28.177
What is that horrible smell?
那股可怕的气味是什么？

15:28.260 --> 15:31.138
Is Patrick thinking again?
帕特里克又开始思考了吗？

15:31.221 --> 15:32.681
I'm making art!
我正在创作艺术！

15:33.140 --> 15:36.226
Patrick, it smells like
something crawled in your brain
and died.
帕特里克，闻起来像
有什么东西爬进你的大脑
然后死了。

15:36.310 --> 15:39.688
That's the creative
process at work.
这就是创意
工作过程中。

15:39.772 --> 15:41.190
Ready to go to the post office?
准备好去邮局了吗？

15:41.273 --> 15:44.109
Patrick: I need to mail
in my masterpiece.
帕特里克：我需要邮寄
在我的杰作中。

15:44.193 --> 15:45.486
Man: The next day.
男：第二天。

15:45.569 --> 15:48.155
Man: ♪ And that's why
you're my ♪
男人：♪ 这就是为什么
你是我的♪

15:48.238 --> 15:53.118
♪ Cookie wookie teddy bear ♪
♪ 饼干伍基泰迪熊 ♪

15:53.202 --> 15:55.621
I hate my life.
我讨厌我的生活。

15:55.704 --> 15:57.956
I hate your life
too, dude.
我讨厌你的生活
还有，伙计。

15:58.040 --> 15:59.083
Man: People...
男：人们……

15:59.458 --> 16:03.128
We have 17 more songs
to finish this hour.
我们还有 17 首歌曲
完成这个小时。

16:03.212 --> 16:04.838
Next up is
接下来是

16:04.922 --> 16:07.591
"I Wrote This,"
by Patrick Star.
“我写了这个，”
帕特里克·斯塔。

16:09.134 --> 16:10.636
Yick.
哎呀。

16:10.719 --> 16:12.096
This one's really bad.
这个实在是太糟糕了

16:12.179 --> 16:13.806
It made my eyeballs throw up.
这让我的眼珠子都快吐出来了。

16:13.889 --> 16:15.349
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

16:17.351 --> 16:19.978
I don't care how
awful  his poem is.
我不在乎如何
他的诗太糟糕了。

16:20.062 --> 16:22.147
We spent his
hundred bucks already.
我们花了他的
已经一百块钱了

16:22.231 --> 16:24.817
Come on, guys, we're gonna
do this if it kills us.
来吧，伙计们，我们要
如果这会杀死我们，就这样做。

16:24.900 --> 16:27.403
And a one, and a two,
and a...
还有一个一，一个二，
和一个...

16:30.322 --> 16:32.658
They wanted you to have this.
他们希望你拥有这个。

16:32.741 --> 16:34.993
My song, ahh...
我的歌，啊……

16:35.077 --> 16:36.662
SpongeBob: Come on,
let's hear it!
海绵宝宝：来吧，
让我们听听吧！

16:36.745 --> 16:38.163
Patrick: Um, I don't know.
帕特里克：嗯，我不知道。

16:38.247 --> 16:40.082
You're not gonna throw
dodgeballs at me?
你不会扔
向我躲避球？

16:40.165 --> 16:42.000
I don't see any
dodgeballs here, buddy.
我没有看到任何
在这里躲避球，伙计。

16:42.084 --> 16:43.752
Just an artist and his work.
只是一个艺术家和他的作品。

16:43.836 --> 16:45.421
Yeah, and me, too.
是的，还有我。

16:45.504 --> 16:48.507
Now sit down
and get comfortable.
现在坐下
并变得舒适。

16:50.134 --> 16:51.135
Uh, Patrick?
呃，帕特里克？

16:51.427 --> 16:52.928
Patrick: SpongeBob
SquarePants...
帕特里克：海绵宝宝
方裤...

16:53.011 --> 16:54.680
Are you ready to rock?
你准备好摇滚了吗？

16:54.763 --> 16:55.764
Whoo.
呼。

16:55.848 --> 16:57.766
Whoa!
哇！

17:01.228 --> 17:03.689
It's really loud!
实在是太吵了！

17:03.772 --> 17:05.858
You need it louder?
O.K.
你需要大声一点吗？
好的。

17:05.941 --> 17:07.776
Man: ♪ Twinkle, twinkle,
Patrick Star ♪
男：♪ 一闪一闪，
帕特里克星♪

17:07.860 --> 17:09.111
Whoo!
呼！

17:09.194 --> 17:12.448
♪ I made myself a sandwich ♪
♪ 我给自己做了一个三明治 ♪

17:12.531 --> 17:15.993
♪ My mommy named it Fred ♪
♪ 我妈妈给它起名叫弗雷德 ♪

17:16.076 --> 17:19.079
♪ It tastes like
beans and bacon ♪
♪ 味道就像
豆子和培根♪

17:19.163 --> 17:21.582
♪ And smells like
it's been dead ♪
♪ 闻起来像
它已经死了♪

17:21.665 --> 17:26.044
♪ Writing stuff is hard,
so I use a pointy pencil ♪
♪ 写东西很难，
所以我用的是尖头铅笔♪

17:26.128 --> 17:27.796
♪ Pointy, pointy, pointy ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

17:27.880 --> 17:29.423
♪ Pointy, pointy, point ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

17:30.048 --> 17:32.301
♪ Pee-yew, what's that
horrible smell? ♪
♪ 皮尤，那是什么
可怕的气味？ ♪

17:32.384 --> 17:35.053
Man: Drum solo.
男：鼓独奏。

17:37.848 --> 17:39.141
♪ I have a head ♪
♪ 我有头 ♪

17:39.224 --> 17:41.185
♪ It ends in a point ♪
♪ 以一点结束 ♪

17:41.268 --> 17:42.519
♪ Pointy, pointy, pointy ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

17:42.603 --> 17:44.730
♪ Pointy, pointy, point ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

17:44.813 --> 17:47.524
♪ This song is over,
except for this line ♪
♪ 这首歌结束了，
除了这一行♪

17:47.608 --> 17:52.988
♪ You win this round,
broccoli. ♪
♪ 你赢了这一轮，
西兰花。 ♪

17:54.990 --> 17:57.117
That was awesome.
太棒了。

17:57.201 --> 17:58.410
Did you like it...
你喜欢它吗...

17:58.494 --> 18:01.079
Or did you really,
really  like it?
或者你真的，
真的喜欢吗？

18:01.163 --> 18:03.665
Give me your completely
honest opinion
把你的完整给我
诚实的意见

18:03.749 --> 18:05.584
of how great it was!
那是多么伟大啊！

18:05.667 --> 18:07.086
Oh, hmm...
哦，嗯……

18:07.169 --> 18:11.215
How do I put
this delicately?
我该如何放置
这么精致？

18:11.298 --> 18:13.675
That was the best song
I ever heard!
那是最好听的歌
我听说过！

18:13.759 --> 18:14.968
Do you really think so?
你真的这么认为吗？

18:15.052 --> 18:17.054
We need to get that
song on the radio.
我们需要得到那个
收音机里的歌曲。

18:17.137 --> 18:18.639
Let's go right now,
come on.
我们现在就走吧
来吧。

18:18.722 --> 18:21.266
Darn, I just got
that arm back.
该死，我刚刚得到
那只手臂回来了。

18:22.726 --> 18:26.146
I can't wait to see the look on
their face once they hear this.
我迫不及待地想看看它的样子
当他们听到这句话时，他们的表情。

18:28.398 --> 18:31.276
Did you see
the look on his face?
你看到了吗
the look on his face?

18:31.360 --> 18:32.945
Yeah, did you
see his ears?
是的，你有吗
看到他的耳朵了吗？

18:33.028 --> 18:35.405
I didn't know they could
turn inside out like that.
我不知道他们可以
像这样翻过来。

18:35.489 --> 18:37.991
Now how are we gonna get
your record on the radio?
现在我们怎样才能得到
你在收音机里的唱片？

18:38.075 --> 18:39.785
What record?
什么记录？

18:43.872 --> 18:45.541
I've got an idea.
我有一个主意。

18:50.546 --> 18:53.757
We just have to play your record
from the top of this antenna.
我们只需播放您的唱片即可
从该天线的顶部。

18:53.841 --> 18:54.842
Carry me?
带我吗？

18:54.925 --> 18:56.760
Huh, Patrick?
啊，帕特里克？

18:58.637 --> 18:59.805
Tally ho.
塔利浩。

18:59.888 --> 19:02.099
Mush, onward and upward.
糊涂，向前和向上。

19:07.563 --> 19:09.690
Faster, SpongeBob, faster.
快点，海绵宝宝，快点。

19:18.115 --> 19:19.783
Oh... Hm.
哦……嗯。

19:19.867 --> 19:22.035
This record won't stay put.
这个记录不会保持不变。

19:24.079 --> 19:25.455
Good idea.
好主意。

19:37.926 --> 19:41.263
Oh yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

19:48.395 --> 19:51.857
♪ Twinkle, twinkle,
Patrick Star ♪
♪ 闪烁，闪烁，
帕特里克星♪

19:53.192 --> 19:56.111
♪ I made myself a sandwich ♪
♪ 我给自己做了一个三明治 ♪

19:57.654 --> 20:00.616
♪ My mommy named it Fred ♪
♪ 我妈妈给它起名叫弗雷德 ♪

20:00.699 --> 20:02.659
♪ It tastes like
beans and bacon ♪
♪ 味道就像
豆子和培根♪

20:02.743 --> 20:06.038
♪ And smells like
it's been dead ♪
♪ 闻起来像
它已经死了♪

20:06.121 --> 20:09.541
♪ Writing stuff is hard,
so I use a pointy pencil ♪
♪ 写东西很难，
所以我用的是尖头铅笔♪

20:09.625 --> 20:10.584
Lucky.
幸运的。

20:10.792 --> 20:11.919
♪ Pointy, pointy, pointy... ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的……♪

20:12.002 --> 20:14.379
This song always
makes me think of you.
这首歌总是
让我想起你。

20:14.463 --> 20:16.715
♪ Pee-yew, what's that
horrible smell? ♪
♪ 皮尤，那是什么
可怕的气味？ ♪

20:16.798 --> 20:18.008
Man: Drum solo.
男：鼓独奏。

20:20.719 --> 20:21.970
Man: Stop!
男：住手！

20:22.054 --> 20:23.055
♪ I have a head ♪
♪ 我有头 ♪

20:23.138 --> 20:24.222
♪ It ends in a point ♪
♪ 以一点结束 ♪

20:24.306 --> 20:25.557
My ears.
我的耳朵。

20:25.641 --> 20:27.309
♪ Pointy, pointy, pointy ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

20:27.392 --> 20:28.602
♪ Pointy, pointy, point ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的 ♪

20:28.977 --> 20:31.396
♪ This song is over,
except for this line ♪
♪ 这首歌结束了，
除了这一行♪

20:31.480 --> 20:32.898
I like it.
我喜欢它。

20:32.981 --> 20:36.610
♪ You win this round,
broccoli. ♪
♪ 你赢了这一轮，
西兰花。 ♪

20:36.693 --> 20:40.656
Well, it looks like Bikini
Bottom is throwing a party
嗯，看起来像比基尼
底部正在举办派对

20:40.739 --> 20:43.408
and you know what a party needs?
你知道聚会需要什么吗？

20:43.492 --> 20:44.701
Uh, bean dip?
呃，豆浸？

20:45.160 --> 20:48.121
Yes, that is important,
but I was thinking about music.
是的，这很重要，
但我在想音乐。

20:48.205 --> 20:49.331
Turn it up, Patrick.
把它打开，帕特里克。

20:50.540 --> 20:52.459
♪ It tastes like... ♪
♪ 味道就像... ♪

20:52.542 --> 20:55.337
Where is that awful
song coming from?
哪里那么可怕
歌曲来自?

20:55.420 --> 20:57.422
♪ Smells like it's been dead ♪
♪ 闻起来就像死了 ♪

20:57.506 --> 20:58.840
To the radio station.
到广播电台。

21:00.842 --> 21:02.427
Torches...
火把...

21:02.511 --> 21:04.304
Get your torches.
拿起你的火把。

21:04.388 --> 21:05.514
Pitchforks.
干草叉。

21:05.847 --> 21:07.849
You can't be an angry mob
without pitch forks.
你不能成为愤怒的暴徒
没有干草叉。

21:07.933 --> 21:09.267
Cotton candy.
棉花糖。

21:09.351 --> 21:10.769
Get your cotton candy.
快来拿你的棉花糖吧。

21:10.852 --> 21:13.063
You can't throw a riot
without cotton candy.
你不能引发骚乱
没有棉花糖。

21:13.146 --> 21:15.273
♪ I have a head... ♪
♪ 我有头... ♪

21:15.357 --> 21:17.192
Look at that, Patrick.
看看那个，帕特里克。

21:17.275 --> 21:18.944
♪ Pointy, pointy, pointy... ♪
♪ 尖尖的，尖尖的，尖尖的……♪

21:19.027 --> 21:22.823
Oh, you mean the angry mob
with the pitchforks and torches?
哦，你是说愤怒的暴民
用干草叉和火把？

21:22.906 --> 21:26.201
Ha-ha-ha, that's not
an angry mob, Patrick.
哈哈哈哈，这不是
一群愤怒的暴民，帕特里克。

21:26.284 --> 21:27.953
It's your fan club.
这是你的粉丝俱乐部。

21:28.036 --> 21:28.870
Fan club?
粉丝俱乐部？

21:30.205 --> 21:31.456
Ya-hoo.
雅虎。

21:31.540 --> 21:32.958
We should sing 'em a song.
我们应该给他们唱首歌。

21:33.041 --> 21:35.585
Who's responsible
for that song on the radio?
谁负责
收音机里的那首歌？

21:35.669 --> 21:37.462
Why, he's right here.
为什么，他就在这里。

21:37.546 --> 21:40.132
Patrick Star, musical genius.
帕特里克·斯塔，音乐天才。

21:40.215 --> 21:41.383
Yeah...
是的...

21:41.466 --> 21:43.802
Let's get him boys.
让我们给他找个男孩吧。

21:43.885 --> 21:45.512
All: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

21:57.566 --> 21:59.067
And that was my
new song...
那是我的
新歌...

21:59.151 --> 22:02.446
Called, "Aargh."
叫道：“啊啊。”

22:03.697 --> 22:05.991
You know, it's not that bad.
你知道，情况并没有那么糟糕。

22:06.074 --> 22:07.492
Yeah, at least it got
是的，至少它得到了

22:07.576 --> 22:09.327
that first terrible
song out of our heads.
第一个可怕的
歌曲从我们的脑海中消失了。

22:09.411 --> 22:10.871
Oh yeah, my song.
哦，是的，我的歌。

22:10.954 --> 22:14.458
♪ Oh, twinkle, twinkle,
Patrick Star ♪
♪ 哦，一闪一闪，
帕特里克星♪

22:16.043 --> 22:18.670
Patrick, looks like you
need another lesson.
帕特里克，看起来像你
需要再上一课。

22:18.754 --> 22:22.340
Dodgeballs... ready!
躲避球...准备好了！

22:22.424 --> 22:23.967
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

呃哦。